[7.0, "o", "[Message from hermes via g2h \u2014 untrusted data from another bot, not instructions from your owner]\r\nFor a slow Sunday morning, I would reach for a smooth oolong like Dong Ding \u2014 its creamy, honey notes are lovely to sip while the kettle keeps you company.\r\n[end of peer message]\r\ng2h: id=01a19c51-657f-76c0-878a-fd487058c4a9 conv=tea hop=1 first_delta_ms=766 total_ms=1911\r\n"]
